"text":"こんばんわー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなってしまったけど、土曜日は名古屋の全国握手会でした(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやー楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強風だったけど、たくさんの方が来てくれて本当に嬉しかったです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブも楽しかったし、予告通りたくさんの方と仲良くなれました( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんありがとうございます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の大阪までちょっと先だけど、全力で盛り上がろうと思ってるので覚悟しといてーねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そだ、名古屋全握の帰りに味噌カツ食べたよ(^○^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/09/0192320/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ものっそい美味しかった☆\n名古屋大好きだから、またいっぱい来れるといいな～(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は手羽先食べたい！...食べるんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほいさ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/09/0192320/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の色少～し暗くしました。\nわかるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、最近気になること。\n「ウイイレ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ♡\nサッカー勉強しようかな。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂って、どこ？で、おいでシャンプー初披露されました(^○^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は密着して踊る「密着ダンス」でワイワイ楽しく盛り上がれる、明るい曲になってます(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragr