ype":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は休憩中です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が何か言葉を発すると最近何でも「そっちこそ」って言ってきます（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなななみんが私は大好きだーーーーー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんから、エレベーターの乗り方を東京に来てから初めて知ったと言う話を今日聞いて「嘘でしょ！」って思ったんだけど、本気トーンで言われてびっくりした今日の出来事...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなななみも大好きだーーーーー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと言うことで、準備に取りかかります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またねん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/21/2898921/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-17332":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2014/03/17/4189722/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あともうちょいで使い切る\nボールペンのインク。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはなんとしてでも\n使い切りたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボールペンのインクってあたしの\nイメージ的にあんま使い切った\nことがないから....だから使い切る！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"したらまた新しいやつを使うの...\nでもこのボールペン使い始めたの\n高3だったような...."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使い切るには何年もかかる\nようですな٩(๑❛ʚ❛๑)۶ぷへー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして前回の記事の問題ですが\nコメントを読んでいると\n真夏・なな・さゆ・あしゅ\nが多かったですね꒰๑͒ ु•ꇵ͒•`๑͒꒱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ絶対超難問だろっ\\(°Д° )/\nって思って出したのに....\nむむむお主らやりおるな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正解はなな♡♡♡でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2014/03/17/4189722/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません\\(°Д° )/\n最近撮ったななとの写真が\nありませんでした。笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度あった時にしっかり\n撮っておきます。笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやでもあたしのおでこ全開も\nなかなかなかなかなかレアだと\n思うのですが....\nお気に召されましたか？♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2014/03/17/4189722/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}}